  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bulunguli Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant for Bulunguli Farmers&apos; Multipurpose Cooperative Society will focus on the production of maize grain and flour. The key activity to be funded under this project is provision of storage infrastructure, value addition equipment, working capital and training. These will result in increasing the quantity of maize produced, bulked, processed and sold to fetch higher incomes for farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
